/**

\mainpage Fl_Dockable_Area Programming Manual

Fl_Dockable_Area is a library of docking panels for the Fast Light Tool Kit
(FLTK).  It is a middle layer between FLTK's Fl_Dockable_Group, which moves a
group out of its window and back, and an application: it docks panels along
the borders of a center widget, as tabs and in stacks, floats them, puts them
on stripes, and saves and restores where they are.

